<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-wrapper">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Siap Untuk Mulai Belajar?</h2>
        <p>Ribuan Sahabat Tahseena telah membuktikan kemajuan bacaan mereka. Kini giliran Anda! Pilih program yang sesuai dan mulai perjalanan Al-Qur'an yang menyenangkan.</p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Assalamu%27alaikum%20Admin%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20untuk%20mendaftar%20program%20bimbingan%20Al-Qur%27an%20di%20Tahseena." target="_blank" class="btn-primary">Pilih Program</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Assalamu%27alaikum%20Admin%2C%20saya%20ingin%20bertanya%20seputar%20pembelajaran%20di%20Tahseena." target="_blank" class="btn-secondary">
            Hubungi Admin
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="whatsapp-icon"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Dekorasi Aksesn Kaca -->
      <div class="cta-decoration"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    padding: 80px 0 120px 0;
    font-family: var(--font-main);
    background: var(--bg-body) !important;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .cta-wrapper {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2876B4 0%, #26C6DA 100%);
    border-radius: 40px;
    padding: 70px 50px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(40, 118, 180, 0.2);
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.5s ease;
  }

  /* Dark Mode Aesthetic: Midnight Crystal */
  :global([data-theme='dark']) .cta-wrapper {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8) 0%, rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.95) 100%);
    border-color: rgba(38, 198, 218, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 0 30px rgba(38, 198, 218, 0.15), inset 0 0 20px rgba(38, 198, 218, 0.05);
  }

  .cta-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta-wrapper h2 {
    color: white;
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .cta-wrapper p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 40px 0;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: white;
    color: #2876B4;
    padding: 18px 40px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    color: white;
    padding: 16px 35px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    border-color: white;
    transform: translateY(-5px);
  }

  .whatsapp-icon {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }

  /* Dekorasi artistik di background banner */
  .cta-decoration {
    position: absolute;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.2) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%);
    top: -150px;
    right: -100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .cta-wrapper::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%);
    bottom: -100px;
    left: -100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cta-wrapper {
      padding: 50px 30px;
      border-radius: 30px;
    }
    .cta-wrapper h2 {
      font-size: 2.22rem;
    }
    .cta-wrapper p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .cta-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 15px;
    }
    .btn-primary, .btn-secondary {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .cta-section { padding-bottom: 80px; }
    .cta-wrapper h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  }
</style>
